    "body": "The \"Web Storage\" section has its own Privacy section and also its own Security section: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#privacy. This organization follows from when those sections were published separately. It might make sense to reconcile those things a bit more or move various (largely considered legacy) storage mechanisms into https://storage.spec.whatwg.org/ to reduce the size of the HTML Standard.",
